# tally 2.1.8 §4 (#169-l), L §3.2 Inline figures and L §7.1: a four-digit literal where money is expected is a
# figure, not a year, so in a def it is LOAD-LITERAL. 2.1.7's refcore read it as a year (LOAD-UNIT year4). T's
# fixes/g1/y4.
=== m.tally
model y4
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

band sc(x: money PLN): num PLN

def z: num PLN = sc(1000) at reader

ask a1: z law 2026-03-01

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  sc: [0, inf) = x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LITERAL figure 1000 in a rule; make it a row (m.tally:12)
